From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] Remove Focus and clock-based pad caps; add RPM targets

Remove the time-based limits and Focus integration, expose direct RPM targets,
and retire the enforcer timer files.

